1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,860
Pronunciation and Status.
发音与身份。

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:01:25,120
An ambassador and a referee were consulting a professor on the caption of a Buddhistic alphabet when a sobbing woman stopped them to sell an antique musical bathtub. Her dirty garment and the handkerchief around her waist were badly in need of being sent to a laundry. The ambassador uncomfortably gave her a handful of pence from his wallet and said, “Take this fortune away, troublesome woman.” When her figure faded away, the brilliant professor said, “You are mistaken and your improper remark on her should be condemned.
一位大使和一位裁判正在请教一位教授，询问一套佛教字母的说明文字，这时，一个抽泣的女人拦住了他们，想卖给他们一个古董音乐浴缸。她肮脏的衣服和围在腰上的手帕，急需送进洗衣店清洗。大使有些不自在，给了她一把硬币，从钱包里掏出来，并说道：“拿着这笔钱走吧，你这个烦人的女人。”她的身影逐渐消失后，那位聪明的教授说：“你错了，你对她的不当评论应该受到谴责。

3
00:01:25,120 --> 00:02:26,813
In terms of this extraordinary woman, you can’t classify her status by her horrible clothes or disgusting nails. Her clean woolen vest and stockings, especially her classic pronunciation, all suggested her upper status.” The ambassador gave a whistle in amazement, and advised making her acquaintance. The professor hesitated for a while, then compromised.
说到这位不同寻常的女士，你不能凭她糟糕的衣服和脏指甲判断她的身份。她干净的羊毛背心和长袜，尤其是她规范的发音，都暗示着她较高的社会地位。”大使惊讶地吹了一声口哨，建议去结识她。教授犹豫了一会儿，随后同意了。

4
00:02:26,813 --> 00:03:29,307
The outcome was that she was an authentic superior police officer. When they were shown in her office and saw her once more, she brought them a teapot of tea and some cookies, laughing and saying, “I rubbed some cream and wax on my garment and passed myself off as a shabby woman among thieves and robbers to investigate a plot. Generally speaking, your overlooking me and my adaptation are the best help.
结果，她竟是一位货真价实的高级警官。当他们被领进她的办公室，再次见到她时，她给他们端来一壶茶和一些饼干，笑着说：“我在衣服上抹了些乳霜和蜡，把自己伪装成一个衣衫褴褛的女人，混在小偷和强盗中间，调查一场阴谋。一般来说，你们不注意我，加上我的随机应变，就是最好的帮助。

5
00:03:29,307 --> 00:03:36,500
But my pronunciation seemed to have betrayed me.”
但我的发音似乎暴露了我。”
